{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309260","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309260","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1130926001:1":{"text":"Hey, don't go accusing me of anything! Why would I pick on these kids when their parents paid me this much to watch over them?!","source_cn":"喂！别冤枉好人！我收了好大一笔钱，接了委托来看护他们，...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD329597823FC2983","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Hey, don't go accusing me of anything! Why would I pick on these kids when their parents paid me this much to watch over them?!","female":"Hey, don't go accusing me of anything! Why would I pick on these kids when their parents paid me this much to watch over them?!","variant_male_record_index":"118672","variant_female_record_index":"118673","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130926002:1":{"text":"Just look at him, whining about his parents. How am I supposed to know where they went?!","source_cn":"看看他，一个劲地追问他父母去哪里了。我怎么会知道？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4ED3E8A77027703B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130926003:1":{"text":"Seriously... quit crying, kid.","source_cn":"真是的……别哭了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1966DD890260BC78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1130926004:1":{"text":"*Sniffling* Mama... Papa...","source_cn":"呜呜……爹……娘……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD39C8DC39CE09207","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1130926004":{"text":"*Sniffling* Mama... Papa...","source_cn":"呜呜……爹……娘……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD39C8DC39CE09207","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1130926005:1":{"text":"The Mauler who hired us said they went treasure hunting in the Crimson Highlands.","source_cn":"委托我们的蛮血说，他们的父母去深红高原寻找宝藏了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFA831087A3F2124","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1130926006:1":{"text":"I—I'm going to find them!","source_cn":"——我要去找他们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE4604E429C67B55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1130926007:1":{"text":"The heck you are, kid! They paid me to keep an eye on you, and I'm not about to let you become some wild beast's dinner!","source_cn":"说什么傻话！我收了钱要看着你们！你出去会被发疯的野兽吃掉的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC162606A08073885","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1130926008:1":{"text":"B-But that means my parents... Waaaaaah!","source_cn":"那、那爹娘他们不就……呜呜呜呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C3EBD66B2EE357C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1130926009:1":{"text":"Argh, not again! That's not what I meant, kid! I'm sure... almost sure that your parents didn't get eaten!","source_cn":"哎呀，你怎么又哭上了！我不是这个意思！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x800F5788469BE8EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1130926010:1":{"text":"Alas... it's hopeless. I've never had to coddle a kid before.","source_cn":"唉……真没办法。我没哄过孩子啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F36729C8D1349D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"Where are his parents?","source_cn":"他的父母呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x14A79D5E5CAC019C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Where are his parents?","female":"Where are his parents?","variant_male_record_index":"62996","variant_female_record_index":"62997","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:赏金猎人塞隆":{"text":"Hunter Cylon","source":"赏金猎人塞隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:蛮血比提":{"text":"Brett","source":"蛮血比提","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}}